Vita: measurement only (the main-thread actor profile's execute detail, as patches/dusklight/0030).
J3DModel::calc opens execute detail part 0 (j3d_calc): model calc per actor type, including models
an actor calculates directly (the horse, Link) rather than through mDoExt_McaMorf. calc is virtual,
so the port's link wrap of it never fired. Outside sampled sub frames one flag test. No game
behaviour changes: same calls, same order, same results.

